WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.169
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.537
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.671
And now if you don't mind,
we are going to get to the news.

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:06.740
The White House is reportedly

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.775
planning to present
President Biden

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:11.844
with a birthday cake on Saturday
at his granddaughter's wedding.

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:13.513
And if you're wondering
how old he is,

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:16.382
he'll be at his
granddaughter's wedding.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:18.951
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:21.020
That's right, President Biden
will celebrate

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.689
his 80th birthday on Sunday,

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.859
while Fox News will celebrate it
all year long, baby!

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.061
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:30.296
In a speech today
from the House floor,

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:33.465
Speaker Nancy Pelosi announced
she will not seek another term

00:00:33.465 --> 00:00:34.734
as Democratic leader,

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.236
but will remain in Congress
to finish her term.

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:38.337
Meanwhile, in the Senate,

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:41.140
his eternal curse
remains unbroken.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:43.209
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.711
The Senate yesterday
passed a bill

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.814
to expand medical-marijuana
research by unanimous consent.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:50.950
They also decided,
by an 85-15 vote,

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.319
that unanimous is a funny word.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.355
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.196
Former White House
Chief of Staff

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:04.831
Mick Mulvaney
said in a new interview

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.299
that he thinks
former president Trump

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:10.670
is "the only Republican who
can lose in the 2024 election."

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.939
"Hold my beer,"
said Herschel Walker

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:13.973
to a mailbox.

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.509
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:21.814
During a campaign stop
yesterday in Georgia,

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:23.583
Republican Senate candidate
Herschel Walker

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.751
spent more than two minutes
trying to recount

00:01:25.751 --> 00:01:28.354
plot details from
an untitled vampire movie.

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:31.057
Said Walker,
"Oh, it's not a movie."

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:34.094
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:38.498
Tell 'em, mailbox.

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:44.303
At the same stop, Republican
Senate candidate Herschel Walker

00:01:44.303 --> 00:01:46.139
talked about werewolves
and vampires and said,

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:48.040
"I don't want to be
a vampire anymore.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.342
I want to be a werewolf."

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:50.543
Well, one thing's for certain,

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.211
he definitely doesn't
want to be a senator.

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.713
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.681 --> 00:01:57.750
Fans of the singer Morrissey
are upset

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.386
after he recently
ended his concert abruptly

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.155
after just 30 minutes
without any warning.

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:04.690
Fortunately, if there's
one thing Morrissey fans love,

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:06.993
it's when Morrissey
makes them upset.

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:10.029
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:14.233
You know I'm zinging a couple
of old-high school girlfriends

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:15.234
with that one.

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:18.237
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.237 --> 00:02:21.774
A man in Japan had
to remove a 90-inch jump rope --

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.209
removed from his bladder

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:26.613
after he shoved the rope
into his penis.

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:30.984
On the bright side, he finally
got those kids off his lawn.

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:41.661
Do we have to show the X-ray?

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:44.531
A jump rope.

00:02:46.064 --> 00:02:49.235
Microsoft yesterday added
a collection of classic games

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:52.071
to its Teams platform,
including solitaire.

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:56.709
Yeah, 'cause what says "teams"
more than solitaire?

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.610
The point is, you do it alone.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.780
Did you also add "Cranking It"?

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.815
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:12.225
We were doing the -- We're doing
that jump-rope-penis bit.

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:15.862
What's a good palate cleanser?

00:03:19.098 --> 00:03:22.969
Let's use an early '90s slang
for masturbation.

00:03:25.003 --> 00:03:28.508
That also reminds me of those
Morrissey fans.

00:03:28.508 --> 00:03:30.643
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:33.379
A Florida scientist recently
found an entire alligator

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:34.914
inside a Burmese python.

00:03:34.914 --> 00:03:37.316
It's what -- It is -- Oh [bleep]

00:03:37.316 --> 00:03:39.252
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:40.920
This is -- And I feel bad
because this is

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.622
maybe the tightest of
all the jokes.

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:44.357
This is maybe
the most tightly written,

00:03:44.357 --> 00:03:46.192
and that's why I'm going to
take it back,

00:03:46.192 --> 00:03:48.728
because, you know,
credit where credit's due.

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:53.399
Just try to think of anything
else to clear your mind.

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:55.735
Maybe the jump-rope penis.

00:03:58.003 --> 00:04:00.906
A Florida scientist recently
found an entire alligator

00:04:00.906 --> 00:04:02.441
inside a Burmese python.

00:04:02.441 --> 00:04:06.712
It's what's called
a Florida turducken.

00:04:06.712 --> 00:04:08.647
Pretty good joke.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:08.647 --> 00:04:10.250
Pretty good joke.

00:04:13.352 --> 00:04:18.057
We couldn't get the X-ray
of what that would look like?

